### Navigation menus (MAIN bootstraps from link_to_menu pages on first read)

GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/menus?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/menus/MAIN?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Replace the whole tree (one level of nesting; broken PAGE targets come back flagged)
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/menus/MAIN?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "items": [
    {"labels": {"en": "Shop", "ar": "تسوّق"}, "target": {"kind": "URL", "value": "/category/all"}, "children": [
      {"labels": {"en": "Office"}, "target": {"kind": "CATEGORY", "value": "office"}},
      {"labels": {"en": "Warehouse"}, "target": {"kind": "CATEGORY", "value": "warehouse"}}
    ]},
    {"labels": {"en": "Bulk ordering"}, "target": {"kind": "PAGE", "value": "bulk-ordering"}},
    {"labels": {"en": "Blog"}, "target": {"kind": "BLOG_INDEX"}},
    {"labels": {"en": "Help"}, "target": {"kind": "FAQ_INDEX"}}
  ]
}
